# Brave the Wilds, not bargained: no sacrifice and no target (the land slot exists only if the spell was bargained, CR 601.2b-c).
# The Forest stays a plain land, and the basic land (a Mountain) is put into the hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Jet
Brave the Wilds
Island x4
Mountain x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Brave the Wilds.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Cast without bargain)
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Search(Mountain)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Types = Land
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Subtypes = Forest

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Brave the Wilds
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Jet
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Stack.Count = 0
